cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Neuronal Data Analyzer Lab
message: >-
  If you use this software, or results produced with it, in work that you
  publish or present, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Alejandro
    family-names: Suarez
    email: alesr713@gmail.com
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0931-8512"
repository-code: "https://github.com/alesuarez92/NeuronalDataAnalyzerLab"
url: "https://toolbox.neuroanalyzerlab.com"
abstract: >-
  Neuroscience analysis toolbox in MATLAB for blood flow (laser Doppler and
  laser speckle flowmetry), electrophysiology (LFP, MUA, spike sorting), EEG
  (raw and cleaned, ERPs, scalp maps, time–frequency, statistics), imaging
  over time (ΔF/F, motion correction, cell detection, vessel diameter),
  histology and culture cell counts, and response features with group
  statistics; with batch processing, session files, quality checks, reports
  and methods text.
keywords:
  - neuroscience
  - electrophysiology
  - laser-doppler-flowmetry
  - calcium-imaging
  - eeg
  - laser-speckle
  - histology
  - lfp
  - mua
  - signal-processing
  - matlab
